{
  "about": "The TDLib functions the core may ask of a linked Telegram account's engine (docs/TELEGRAM_PLAN.md, The broker). The desktop app's broker is built from this file (apps/desktop/src/telegram/functions.rs), and nothing changes it while the app runs. A function maps to true, or to the values each named field may have. Anything not here is refused: deleting the account, its password, number or login email, ending other sessions, payments, contacts from an address book, proxies, raw queries. The broker itself signs out and closes the engine.",
